\newlabel{tab:3x3}{{2}{8}{$3{\times }3{\times }3$ on 1000 hundred-move scrambles, all solutions replay-verified. Each method uses its native beam scoring (value vs.\^^Mcumulative log-likelihood); see Figure~\ref {fig:width} for the implementation-matched comparison}{table.caption.13}{}}
